<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Wisconsin Vibes</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --sky: #dff3ff;
            --lake: #5ca7d6;
            --forest: #2e6f4f;
            --gold: #f4c542;
            --cream: #f8f4ea;
            --deep: #1f2d2a;
            --accent: #d9762f;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--sky), #eef7fb 30%, #f9f5ef 100%);
            color: var(--deep);
        }

        .hero {
            min-height: 60vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background:
                linear-gradient(rgba(12, 35, 42, 0.35), rgba(12, 35, 42, 0.45)),
                url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
            margin: 0 0 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.06em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .content {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
        }

        .tagline {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .tagline h2 {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.8rem);
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--forest);
        }

        .tagline p {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #3b4c48;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
            border: 1px solid rgba(46, 111, 79, 0.18);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(18, 47, 55, 0.08);
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: var(--gold);
            color: #4a3100;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
            color: var(--deep);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }

        .card p {
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #33413d;
        }

        .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest), #4c8b64);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .highlight h3 {
            margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
        }

        .highlight p {
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--gold);
            color: #2a2200;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        footer {
            background: #1d2b2a;
            color: #e7efe9;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Wisconsin</h1>
            <p>Where the lakes sparkle, the forests breathe, and the cheese is legendary.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="content">
        <section class="tagline">
            <h2>Pure Northwoods Energy</h2>
            <p>
                From scenic Lake Michigan shorelines to the rolling hills of the Driftless Area,
                Wisconsin brings together cozy towns, friendly faces, and big adventure.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="cards">
            <article class="card">
                <div class="badge">Lakes</div>
                <h3>Freshwater Beauty</h3>
                <p>Endless blue water, sunset views, and peaceful mornings by the shore.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <div class="badge">Forests</div>
                <h3>Northwoods Escape</h3>
                <p>Cool pine air, winding trails, and the kind of quiet that resets your mind.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <div class="badge">Cheese</div>
                <h3>Local Flavor</h3>
                <p>Classic curds, handmade cheese, and comfort-food favorites at every corner.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <div class="badge">Culture</div>
                <h3>Big Heart</h3>
                <p>Tailgate traditions, small-town charm, and a welcoming spirit all year long.</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="highlight">
            <div>
                <h3>Welcome to the Badger State</h3>
                <p>
                    Wisconsin is a place where outdoor adventure, hometown pride, and simple pleasures all come together.
                    It is the kind of place that feels like home the moment you arrive.
                </p>
            </div>
            <a class="cta" href="#">Plan Your Visit</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        Cheers to Wisconsin — lakes, trails, and a little bit of cheese magic.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
